{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1000_p", "source_sha256": "07f2db7065eb2e2a3fcaa5e87839886052d973cb82d870de1c819c423b68647a", "ja": "（紬と環が主演するドラマの撮影日。紬と環は人間界に\n修行にきたお姫様役だ。撮影は順調に進行している）", "zh": "（紬和环主演的电视剧拍摄日。紬和环饰演的是来到人类世界修行的公主。拍摄进展得很顺利）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "f0480eb43842bbd56161381305b95c7d19b69b46d80029f0e0d44e8e0b573706", "ja": "おやぶん、つむぎどこにいったんだろ？\nスタッフさんからジュースもらったのに。", "zh": "老大，紬去哪儿了呢？工作人员还给了我果汁呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8daf09b88da4636c01d65be1a856186aced92d350711e59296b21e6c79350cf2", "ja": "そうだな。ここにいないとなると、\nスタジオの外かもしれないな。ちょっと探してみるか。", "zh": "是啊。既然不在这里，说不定在摄影棚外面。去找找看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "f16555d305418fe36031102eacd694810ef88d12c249f1a5a4e8e0a0e0e1dffb", "ja": "つむぎ、見つけたー！　探したぞ！", "zh": "纺织，找到你啦——！可让我好找！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "aaf2322b08a4c2e2723e8aed90d2848aca37b5201c815eda4f52f5dbfe0e51fd", "ja": "大神さん？　{$P$}も、\nどうしたのですか？", "zh": "大神同学？　{$P$}也是，\n请问有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7f46db3f742dd0a83bd0a2fbcdcb22c08db6dd0a15ef6109a070e15fe46e7464", "ja": "差し入れを貰ったから、紬にもと思ったんだ。\nもしかして、電話中だったか？", "zh": "收到了慰劳品，就想着也拿来给紬一份。\n难道你正在打电话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "99b9c104677523f2cbda520c053efbdbd1a6000a7878a5c3ec0c09e15bf48334", "ja": "はい。ですが、もう終わりましたから大丈夫です。\nそれに、急ぎの用というわけではありませんし。", "zh": "是的。不过已经结束了，没关系。\n而且也不是什么急事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "a3e74b1f2c4b343fc46fb85c997be21874115f1409631150788cae61e3c3d9b1", "ja": "そうなの？\n電話中のつむぎ、すっごく優しい顔してたね！", "zh": "这样啊？\n打电话时的紬，表情特别温柔呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "66c93d180f2564dda0ae6710c2bcfbb81c035fc80c4c4782df89eaee6fdd9502", "ja": "そう、でしたか……。きっと、父と話していたから\nですね。なんだか懐かしい気持ちになってしまって。", "zh": "原来是这样吗……一定是因为刚才在和父亲说话吧。不知怎么的，让我产生了怀念的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1009_p", "source_sha256": "388fbb5977d05febf90e61eaa57135a3f09222d32b9be49a98aad7e00c213264", "ja": "お父さん……ああ、なるほど！　さっきの撮影、ホーム\nシックになった天使を励ますシーンだったもんな。", "zh": "父亲……啊，原来如此！刚才拍摄的是鼓励思乡天使的场景，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8d2c27e3c615f1dd33ee10ee4d4f2d127aafca80612e13ddbec8051148b2d260", "ja": "紬も上京してきて、似たような境遇だ。\nつい故郷を思い出した、と……。", "zh": "紬也是从家乡来到东京，和她有着相似的处境。看来是不由得想起故乡了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cb8137079a1599a4c057f8b56d86d2d13fa5e798b3a3a1fd380af3d559f65b66", "ja": "なっ！？　あ、あなたという人は……！　はっきり\n言うのが恥ずかしいから、濁したというのに……！", "zh": "什！？你、你这个人真是的……！明明是因为不好意思把话说得太明白，才故意含糊带过的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2ce1c3db6815dbe64e5237275bb135dea3b66fc0e406f925082cefb1a1c7f190", "ja": "えっ！？　あ、すまない！", "zh": "咦！？啊，对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "546a3258ff75c4582ab5057e6c7bb422df303054d1459a49d2baa6d05afc2825", "ja": "……ねえねえ、つむぎ。\nもしかして、さびしいの……？", "zh": "……喂喂，紬。\n难道说，你感到寂寞吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "010146727dc52bef2b58586c4cc8652ce6985e2470835c6bb9578c10b51c802d", "ja": "えっ？　あ、その……\n全く寂しくないと言えば、嘘にはなりますが……。", "zh": "诶？啊，那个……\n要说完全不寂寞，也不是实话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "be3abe194f98736944bea5a82b15ac59006985a0b00ee4433bcf5e07963a6de2", "ja": "大神さんや、劇場のみなさんがいるから平気ですよ。\n……それに一応、{$P$}も。", "zh": "有大神在，还有剧场的大家在，所以没事的。\n……而且姑且，也还有{$P$}在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "6661ab25e7c649eb087381ee30d14dc4132bed9fdd5002e3ce541e324a5c09a7", "ja": "たまきも！　つむぎ達が一緒だから毎日楽しいぞ！\nだから、つむぎが同じこと思ってくれててよかった♪", "zh": "小环也是！因为有紬她们陪着我，每天都很开心哦！\n所以，紬也能有同样的想法，真是太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0151bb2e95ed68c5c8202c9c03aa9733336ae2accc6d72d60f057c159ddb99d0", "ja": "ははっ、二人がそう思ってくれて嬉しいよ。\n……あっ、環。渡すものがあるんじゃないか？", "zh": "哈哈，你们两个能这么想，我很开心。\n……啊，环。你不是还有东西要交给我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "5808a41b55ad450001c5db67b5d23574a2a97e99573718a1b84029ea20c0802f", "ja": "忘れてた～！　さっきね、スタッフさんから\nジュースもらったんだ。つむぎも一緒に飲もっ！", "zh": "我都忘了～！刚才工作人员给了我果汁。紬也一起来喝吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "74cdfb44b9be09c2a919b2cac4aefb789f9a074d94682195a2557011af06fa42", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとうございます。私も今日は金平糖を\n持ってきたんです。それも一緒に、いかがですか？", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢您。我今天也带了金平糖，要不要一起吃？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "b7ba8e9f56ad49fe0b3d763c7311f4597688f86e1bb9e539218925fccfba020a", "ja": "やったー！　おかしだ！\nたまき、この後ももっとも～っと頑張れるぞー！", "zh": "太好啦——！有点心吃！\n环接下来也能更～加努力啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ee12eb09ad24fac6921d0d642e5a176a6d0e52fa7630c87fac7446f5a9a25c16", "ja": "はい、私もです。\n私たち二人で、素敵なドラマにしましょうね！", "zh": "好的，我也是。我们两个人一起，拍出一部精彩的电视剧吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0404_1022_p", "source_sha256": "24b12bae08a161961b1884e405a05197b6903fb413cc771077fe60d60bf8639f", "ja": "（休憩後の撮影も、二人の息はバッチリだった。役柄\nみたいに、紬と環も少し成長したかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（休息后的拍摄也配合得天衣无缝。纺和环或许也像剧中的角色一样，稍微成长了一些吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
